        array("id" => "s3e10", "season" => 3, "number" => 10, "name" => "Taboo Index", "airdate" => "8 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Ronie and Tiese are late getting to the dorm. Kirito rushes out in search of them, but no sooner has he gone than Frenica appears. She tells Eugeo about how she's suffered at Humbert's hands, and that Tiese and Ronie went to confront him about it.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/183/459854.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e11", "season" => 3, "number" => 11, "name" => "Central Cathedral", "airdate" => "15 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Kirito and Eugeo are now considered criminals for having violated the Taboo Index and are thrown into the underground prison in the Central Cathedral. Meanwhile, on the Ocean Turtle in the real world, Asuna is watching over Kazuto as he's being treated.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/183/459855.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e12", "season" => 3, "number" => 12, "name" => "The Sage of the Library", "airdate" => "22 Dec 2018", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Kirito and Eugeo escape from their cell, only to find their way blocked by Eldrie Synthesis Thirty-One, under orders from Alice to lie in wait for them. Kirito and Eugeo struggle against him until Eugeo realizes that he's seen Eldrie somewhere before.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/183/459857.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e13", "season" => 3, "number" => 13, "name" => "Ruler and Mediator", "airdate" => "5 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Cardinal finishes her explanation of the Administrators Origins and gives Kirito a word of warning. Then the three discuss plans to free Alice and save the world from the Administrators control. They're going to need some weapons.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/183/459859.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e14", "season" => 3, "number" => 14, "name" => "The Crimson Knight", "airdate" => "12 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "After being entrusted with the fate of the world by Cardinal, Kirito and Eugeo head to the top floor of the Central Cathedral. They find their confiscated swords, only to be attacked by the bow-wielding Integrity Knight Deusolbert Synthesis Seven.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/183/459860.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e15", "season" => 3, "number" => 15, "name" => "The Relentless Knight", "airdate" => "19 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Kirito and Eugeo are on their way up the stairs of the Central Cathedral when they encounter two girls named Linel and Fizel. As they stand, wondering what two children are doing there, they let their guard down and.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/183/459861.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e16", "season" => 3, "number" => 16, "name" => "The Osmanthus Knight", "airdate" => "26 Jan 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Though riddled with wounds, Kirito manages to activate his Perfect Weapon Control art. Continuing on their way to the top floor of the Central Cathedral, Kirito and Eugeo find themselves standing before a strange-looking floating platform.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/183/459863.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e17", "season" => 3, "number" => 17, "name" => "Truce", "airdate" => "2 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "When Kirito and Alice both unleash the Perfect Weapon Control art in the Cloudtop Garden, the impact rips a hole into the seemingly impregnable Central Cathedral wall, which sends them both flying outside.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/183/459864.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e18", "season" => 3, "number" => 18, "name" => "The Legendary Hero", "airdate" => "9 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Eugeo reaches the ninetieth floor of the Central Cathedral, which turns out to be a vast bathing area. The perplexed Eugeo encounters Bercouli Synthesis One soaking in the bath. Meanwhile, Kirito and Alice are still climbing the Central Cathedral wall.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/183/459865.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e19", "season" => 3, "number" => 19, "name" => "The Seal of the Right Eye", "airdate" => "23 Feb 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Seeing Alice's reaction when he mentioned the name Selka, Kirito decides to tell her the truth about the Integrity Knights. Meanwhile, after being knocked unconscious during his battle with Bercouli, Eugeo awakes on the top floor of the cathedral.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/193/484323.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e20", "season" => 3, "number" => 20, "name" => "Synthesis", "airdate" => "2 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.7, "summary" => "Kirito and Alice reach the communal bath on the nintieth floor. There, they find the Integrity Knight Commander, Bercouli, who's been turned to stone by Chudelkin. Alice breaks down in tears upon seeing her mentor's tragic plight, but then.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/193/484324.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e21", "season" => 3, "number" => 21, "name" => "The 32nd Knight", "airdate" => "9 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Standing in Kirito and Alice's way is Eugeo, who's undergone the Synthesis Ritual and become an Integrity Knight. Kirito is rattled, until Alice admonishes him into resolving to fight Eugeo with everything he's got.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/193/484325.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e22", "season" => 3, "number" => 22, "name" => "Titan of the Sword", "airdate" => "16 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "On the top floor of the Central Cathedral, Kirito, Eugeo, and Alice finally face Administrator. But Chudelkin uses the sacred arts to transform himself into a giant clown and attacks.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/193/484326.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e23", "season" => 3, "number" => 23, "name" => "Administrator", "airdate" => "23 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Cardinal appears on the top floor of Central Cathedral for a showdown with her bitter foe of the last two hundred years. She moves to achieve her objective of deleting Administrator, only to see the fallen sword golem rise up again.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/193/484327.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e24", "season" => 3, "number" => 24, "name" => "My Hero", "airdate" => "30 Mar 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "After Cardinal and Eugeo's defeat, Kirito is about to fight the Pontifex before she manages to transform all of the people who live in the Underworld into a great weapon to repel the Dark Territory's invasion and attack the \"other side\".", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/193/484328.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 4, "name" => "Alicization - War of Underworld", "rating" => 9.3, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s4e1", "season" => 4, "number" => 1, "name" => "In the Far North", "airdate" => "12 Oct 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Six months have passed since the fierce battle against Administrator. Alice has brought Kirito to her childhood home, Rulid Village, where they live peacefully. Gazing out at the world that she saved with Kirito, Alice reflects on all that's happened.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/216/541938.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e2", "season" => 4, "number" => 2, "name" => "Raids", "airdate" => "19 Oct 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "A force from the Dark Territory is attacking Rulid Village. Though she'd lost her purpose in battle, in order to fight for her family, and for the people that Kirito and Eugeo tried to protect, Alice takes up the Osmanthus Blade once again.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/216/541939.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e3", "season" => 4, "number" => 3, "name" => "The Final Load Test", "airdate" => "26 Oct 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "The mysterious group that attacked the Ocean Turtle turns out to be a secret unit under orders from the U.S. National Security Agency. And its leader, Gabriel, has battled Kirito and Sinon before.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/218/546501.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e4", "season" => 4, "number" => 4, "name" => "Dark Territory", "airdate" => "2 Nov 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Shasta, commander of the Dark Territory's dark knights, had intended to use Administrator's death as a chance for peace with the Human Empire. But his plans are thwarted by Emperor Vecta's return to the land of darkness.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/218/546502.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e5", "season" => 4, "number" => 5, "name" => "The Night Before Battle", "airdate" => "9 Nov 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Resolved to fight for humankind, Alice joins the forces of the Human Empire, bringing Kirito with her. But while the forces of darkness boast overwhelming numbers, only thirteen Integrity Knights are available to fight for the Human Empire.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/222/555510.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e6", "season" => 4, "number" => 6, "name" => "Battle of the Knights", "airdate" => "16 Nov 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The Final Load Test has begun, and the Eastern Gate has collapsed. Incited by Gabriel, now Emperor Vecta, the massive army of the land of darkness pushes on towards the Human Empire.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/227/567827.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e7", "season" => 4, "number" => 7, "name" => "Stigma of the Disqualified", "airdate" => "23 Nov 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Integrity Knight Renly Synthesis Twenty-Seven, in battle for the first time, flees his position, allowing goblins from the forces of darkness to infiltrate to the tent where Kirito is.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/227/568446.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e8", "season" => 4, "number" => 8, "name" => "Blood and Life", "airdate" => "30 Nov 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "The powerful formal art unleashed by the Integrity Knight Alice inflicts severe casualties on the forces of darkness. Alice encounters an enemy survivor and learns that Emperor Vecta's objective is to find the \"Priestess of Light.\"", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/229/572825.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e9", "season" => 4, "number" => 9, "name" => "Sword and Fist", "airdate" => "7 Dec 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.7, "summary" => "Upon seeing Alice, Gabriel orders his entire army to capture her. The pugilists guild races ahead of the main force. As Alice and Bercouli try to come up with a strategy to counter them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/230/576233.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e10", "season" => 4, "number" => 10, "name" => "Stacia, the Goddess of Creation", "airdate" => "14 Dec 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "Asuna has logged into the Underworld using the superuser account of Stacia, the Goddess of Creation. After she descends, she is reunited with Kirito, thanks to Ronie and Tiese. But soon Alice arrives, leading to a precarious situation.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/231/579877.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e11", "season" => 4, "number" => 11, "name" => "Heartless Choice", "airdate" => "21 Dec 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Asuna has created a bottomless chasm. The dark knights and the pugilists attempt to cross over to the other side, where the Human Empire Army waits.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/232/582433.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e12", "season" => 4, "number" => 12, "name" => "Ray of Light", "airdate" => "28 Dec 2019", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 8.8, "summary" => "Due to Gabriel's scheme, U.S. players were given black knight accounts, and are now continuously logging in to the Underworld. They begin mercilessly slaughtering soldiers from both the Human Empire Army and the Dark Territory Army.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/234/585348.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e13", "season" => 4, "number" => 13, "name" => "The War of Underworld", "airdate" => "11 Jul 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The ice sniper from Gun Gale Online, Sinon, successfully logon into Underworld using a super account Solus, the goddess of the sun, to help Asuna and Kirito inside the Underworld against tons of Crimson Army and The Dark Knight.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/265/663962.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e14", "season" => 4, "number" => 14, "name" => "End to Eternity", "airdate" => "18 Jul 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Despite its modest size, the Human Empire Army and Asuna valiantly battle the wave of American players surging towards them. But they're hopelessly outnumbered, and the Human Empire soldiers start to fall one after another.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/266/665869.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e15", "season" => 4, "number" => 15, "name" => "Instigation", "airdate" => "25 Jul 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Bercouli pursues Vecta, who's abducted Alice. After a long, vicious battle, Bercouli unleashes his secret sword skill, Uragiri, and finally defeats Vecta, despite having sustained severe injuries himself.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/266/665871.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e16", "season" => 4, "number" => 16, "name" => "Code 871", "airdate" => "1 Aug 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The traitor inside Rath turns out to be a researcher named Yanai. When Higa attempts to restore Kirito, Yanai tries to thwart the operation by holding him at gunpoint. Meanwhile, in the Underworld, Sinon confronts Gabriel, who has logged back in.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/267/668040.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e17", "season" => 4, "number" => 17, "name" => "Prince of Hell", "airdate" => "8 Aug 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.8, "summary" => "Asuna and the others succumb to Vassago and the Chinese/Korean players. Discovering the catatonic Kirito, Vassago kicks his wheelchair over. Enraged, Klein lunges at Vassago, only to be pinned down by enemy players. Just then, someone unexpected appears.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/269/673178.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e18", "season" => 4, "number" => 18, "name" => "Memories", "airdate" => "15 Aug 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 10, "summary" => "Sinon manages to severely damage Gabriel, but her strength has been sapped. Leafa collapses after wiping out the American players. And Asuna, her situation now hopeless, gazes at Kirito. But the Black Swordsman continues to wander through his dreams.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/272/680053.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e19", "season" => 4, "number" => 19, "name" => "Awakening", "airdate" => "22 Aug 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.3, "summary" => "Escaping his nightmares, Kirito regains consciousness at last. With the Night-Sky Blade in his right hand and the broken Blue Rose Sword in his left, he faces off against Vassago, armed with the Mate-Chopper, now enormous in size.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/272/680054.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e20", "season" => 4, "number" => 20, "name" => "The Night-Sky Blade", "airdate" => "29 Aug 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "Alice and Asuna head to the World's End Altar as Kirito confronts Gabriel. Unless he can defeat Gabriel and return to the real world before the maximum-acceleration phase begins, Kirito will have to spend the next 200 years in the Underworld.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/272/680055.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e21", "season" => 4, "number" => 21, "name" => "Beyond Time", "airdate" => "5 Sep 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The maximum-acceleration phase has begun. Alice successfully logs out of the Underworld, but Kirito doesn't make it in time. In the real world, Higa and Kikuoka rush to shut down the STL, in order to disable the maximum-acceleration phase, but…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/273/684977.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e22", "season" => 4, "number" => 22, "name" => "Alice", "airdate" => "12 Sep 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9.5, "summary" => "The \"Rath Attack Incident,\" masterminded by the American National Security Agency, is over. Now head of the newly formed Oceanic Resource Exploration & Research Institution, Rinko unveils Alice to the world as an authentic artificial general intelligence.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/273/684978.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s4e23", "season" => 4, "number" => 23, "name" => "New World", "airdate" => "19 Sep 2020", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => 9, "summary" => "Rinko informs Kazuto that Alice is missing. He's about to rush to the Rath Roppongi branch when the doorbell rings. In a panic, Kazuto throws open the door, only to find a deliveryman there with a huge cardboard box.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/274/686794.jpg"),
    )),
);
